op mul e^(-z)I e^b Sin(-a)
sensor result block1 @copper
sensor result block1 @copper
op add R1? e^(-z)R e^zR
op div R? R1? 2
op add I1? e^zI e^(-z)I
op div I? I1? 2
format "(R?+I?*i)/i"
format "iR?+I?"
sensor result block1 @copper
format "Divisão (a+bi) / (c+di):"
